   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective was to carry out a feasibility study on chemicals management in Albania. The Swedish Chemicals Agency (KemI) has assessed that there is a national interest and commitment to establiish a cooperation on strengthened chemicals management in Albania. KemI has, in cooperation with partners, drafted a project document and pointed to a number of institutional issues which need to be handled in the first phase of the cooperation.</narrative>
   </description>
